ROADMAP.md:512:| R-0621 | A no-libc runtime on the proven path ([decision](docs/decisions.md#decided-2026-11-08-no-libc)) | a later slice, around slices 24–25, replaces libc on the proven path with a runtime of its own; until then libc is a named premise in the trusted-base statement (R-0509); R-0584's direct-syscall launcher removes libc start-up, and this task removes the rest of libc from the proven path; Home: tooling (the runtime) and spec (its contract). Gate: the trusted-base golden no longer lists libc for the proven path | R-0509 |
